cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software and the accompanying manuscript. Local publication draft:
  version and date are provisional pending Carlo Corti's inspection; the Zenodo
  DOI sentinel is intentional and does not assert publication.
type: software
title: 'A358321: exact prime-power enumeration and arithmetic certificates'
authors:
  - family-names: Corti
    given-names: Carlo
    affiliation: Independent researcher
    email: carlo.corti@outlook.com
abstract: >-
  C17/OpenMP enumeration, retained coverage records and Python/PARI arithmetic
  certificates for a locally validated extension of OEIS A358321 through n=19.
  The last minimum and final finite supplement combine native coverage with
  exact exclusions of unfinished prime-power subtrees. Positive certification
  is not a second exhaustive negative enumeration. Includes a monolithic TeX
  manuscript and a bounded package-relative verification driver.
keywords:
  - A358321
  - polygonal numbers
  - distinct prime factors
  - computational number theory
  - arithmetic certificates
